 order by an expression             | t       | t      | t
 order by the partition             | t       | f      | t
 nullable partition                 | t       | f      | t
 join inside                        | t       | t      | t
 join outside                       | t       | f      | t
 aggregate on top                   | t       | f      | t
 nothing left                       | t       | f      | t
 keys of one row                    | t       | f      | t
 rank over a unique order           | t       | f      | t
 second row only                    | t       | f      | t
 first row                          | t       | f      | t
 slice                              | t       | t      | t
 element                            | t       | t      | t
 element past the group             | t       | t      | t
 two slices                         | t       | t      | t
